WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.260
What a black hole is.

00:01.924 --> 00:03.804
Seven thousand light-years from home.

00:04.282 --> 00:09.383
A black hole is a place where gravity is so strong that nothing gets out, not even light.

00:09.895 --> 00:12.650
This one has about twenty times the mass of the Sun.

00:13.161 --> 00:14.898
The mark in the middle is ours.

00:15.461 --> 00:19.923
The scatter of dots to one side is home: the stars this map has measured.
